		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=34251#p34251"><![CDATA[
We recently released Beach Buggy Racing on iOS (AppStore) and Android (Google Play, Amazon), soon to be released on Windows Store/Phone as well.  Split-screen Kart racing on Android TV and FireTV!<br><br><img src="https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/19827153/Web_Images/BBR/Titled%20Hero%20Art_thumb.jpg" class="postimage" alt="Image"><br><br>Trailer:  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pkxE_3WqUR8" class="postlink">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pkxE_3WqUR8</a><br>More Info: <a href="http://www.vectorunit.com/beach-buggy-racing" class="postlink">http://www.vectorunit.com/beach-buggy-racing</a><br><br>As usual, this game was made possible by using Bullet for collision detection and rigid body simulation.  A lot of the power-ups/weapons are physics-based (e.g. Low Gravity, Ball and Chain, Big Tires, Spring, Tornado, Spiked Tires, etc).<br><br>Ralf<br>Vector Unit Inc<br><br><br><img src="https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/19827153/Web_Images/BBR/ImageGallery1_thumb.jpg" class="postimage" alt="Image"><br><br><img src="https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/19827153/Web_Images/BBR/ImageGallery4_thumb.jpg" class="postimage" alt="Image"><br><br><img src="https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/19827153/Web_Images/BBR/ImageGallery5_thumb.jpg" class="postimage" alt="Image"><br><br><img src="https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/19827153/Web_Images/BBR/ImageGallery6_thumb.jpg" class="postimage" alt="Image"><br><br><img src="https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/19827153/Web_Images/BBR/ImageGallery8_thumb.jpg" class="postimage" alt="Image"><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=3518">rknoesel</a> — Mon Oct 27, 2014 8:57 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
